{"seq":2,"slug":"gradual-bidirectional","title":"渐进与双向类型检查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/type-checking-semantic-analysis/practice/gradual-bidirectional","wordCount":1702,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"渐进与双向类型检查\">渐进与双向类型检查</h1><p>一个百万行的 Python 代码库，想要类型安全的好处，但没人能一夜之间给它全部加上注解。一门语言想让程序员少写注解，又要在注解缺失处给出清晰的错误。这两个看似不同的工程难题，分别由渐进类型与双向类型检查来回答。前者让静态与动态在同一程序里和平共处、逐步迁移；后者把类型检查拆成两个方向流动，既省注解又利于报错。它们常常协同出现，共同支撑着当代主流语言务实的类型化道路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>渐进类型（gradual typing）的核心是一个特殊类型——动态类型，记作 <code>?</code>（或 <code>Any</code>、<code>dynamic</code>）。它的特别之处在于既可以「流入」任何类型、也可以「流出」为任何类型，从而在静态代码与动态代码的边界上充当缓冲。双向类型检查（bidirectional typing）则把 <a href=\"type-rules-judgments\">类型规则与判断</a> 的单一判断拆成两个方向：<strong>检查</strong>模式（checking，记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>⇐</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma \\vdash e \\Leftarrow \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇐</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，已知期望类型，验证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 是否符合）与<strong>综合</strong>模式（synthesis，记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma \\vdash e \\Rightarrow \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 自身推出类型）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[双向类型检查] --&gt; B[&quot;综合 ⇒&lt;br/&gt;从表达式推出类型&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;检查 ⇐&lt;br/&gt;对照期望类型验证&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[变量·字面量·函数应用]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[lambda·条件分支·容器字面量]&#10;  B --&gt; D{需要切换?}&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt;|综合得到的类型&lt;br/&gt;对照期望| E[子类型/一致性判定]&#10;  E --&gt; F[通过或报局部错误]\">flowchart TD\n  A[双向类型检查] --&gt; B[\"综合 ⇒&lt;br/&gt;从表达式推出类型\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"检查 ⇐&lt;br/&gt;对照期望类型验证\"]\n  B --&gt; B1[变量·字面量·函数应用]\n  C --&gt; C1[lambda·条件分支·容器字面量]\n  B --&gt; D{需要切换?}\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt;|综合得到的类型&lt;br/&gt;对照期望| E[子类型/一致性判定]\n  E --&gt; F[通过或报局部错误]</pre><p>下表对照渐进类型里几个易混的「类型关系」，它们各管一段边界。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关系</th>\n<th>记号</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>出现位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>子类型</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S &lt;: T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可安全替换</td>\n<td>静态代码内部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S \\sim T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>渐进意义上可互换（含 <code>?</code>）</td>\n<td>跨静/动边界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致子类型</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>≲</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S \\lesssim T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≲</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>一致性 + 子类型的组合</td>\n<td>渐进 + 面向对象</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一致性关系是渐进类型的灵魂：<code>?</code> 与任何类型都「一致」，但一致性不传递（<code>int ~ ?</code> 且 <code>? ~ bool</code>，却 <code>int</code> 与 <code>bool</code> 不一致），这一点与 <a href=\"../type-checking/subtyping-coercion\">子类型与隐式转换</a> 里传递的子类型偏序根本不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双向检查-检查与综合的分工\">双向检查：检查与综合的分工</h2><p>为什么要把判断拆成两个方向？因为不同语法构造适合不同方向。函数应用 <code>f x</code> 适合<strong>综合</strong>：先综合出 <code>f</code> 的类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_1 \\to \\tau_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，据此知道 <code>x</code> 应被检查为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，再综合出整体为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。而 lambda <code>λx.e</code> 适合<strong>检查</strong>：单看 <code>λx.e</code> 无法知道参数类型，但若上下文已给出期望类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_1 \\to \\tau_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，就能把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 派给 <code>x</code>、用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 检查 <code>e</code>——无须任何注解。两个方向在「应用」与「注解」处切换：注解 <code>(e : τ)</code> 把综合切到检查，应用则把检查切回综合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"两个方向的伪代码\">两个方向的伪代码</h3><p>把两个判断分别实现成两个函数，它们互相调用，切换点一目了然。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"synth(Γ, e) -&gt; Type:                       # 综合：Γ ⊢ e ⇒ τ&#10;  case Var(x):   return Γ[x]&#10;  case Lit(n):   return Int&#10;  case App(f, a):&#10;    tf = synth(Γ, f)                       # 先综合 f&#10;    match tf with Fn(tp, tr):&#10;      check(Γ, a, tp)                      # 参数按期望 tp 检查 → 切到 check&#10;      return tr&#10;  case Ann(e0, t): check(Γ, e0, t); return t   # 注解：切到 check&#10;&#10;check(Γ, e, expect) -&gt; unit:               # 检查：Γ ⊢ e ⇐ τ&#10;  case Lambda(x, body):&#10;    match expect with Fn(tp, tr):&#10;      check(Γ ∪ {x: tp}, body, tr)         # 用期望类型派参数 → 无须注解&#10;  default:&#10;    t = synth(Γ, e)                        # 检查不了就退回综合 → 切回 synth&#10;    if t ~ expect then ok else error\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>synth(Γ, e) -> Type:                       # 综合：Γ ⊢ e ⇒ τ</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  case Var(x):   return Γ[x]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  case Lit(n):   return Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  case App(f, a):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tf = synth(Γ, f)                       # 先综合 f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match tf with Fn(tp, tr):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      check(Γ, a, tp)                      # 参数按期望 tp 检查 → 切到 check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return tr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  case Ann(e0, t): check(Γ, e0, t); return t   # 注解：切到 check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>check(Γ, e, expect) -> unit:               # 检查：Γ ⊢ e ⇐ τ</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  case Lambda(x, body):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match expect with Fn(tp, tr):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      check(Γ ∪ {x: tp}, body, tr)         # 用期望类型派参数 → 无须注解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  default:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    t = synth(Γ, e)                        # 检查不了就退回综合 → 切回 synth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if t ~ expect then ok else error</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>App</code> 分支里 <code>synth</code> 调 <code>check</code>，<code>default</code> 分支里 <code>check</code> 调 <code>synth</code>——两个方向互为调用，正是「检查与综合在应用与注解处切换」的字面形式。</p>\n<p>这种分工有两个直接好处，正是 <a href=\"../type-checking/type-inference\">类型推断</a> 末尾提到「局部推断 + 注解兜底」的理论支撑。其一是减少注解：很多本需注解的地方，因为期望类型从上下文流入而省掉。其二是错误局部化：检查模式始终带着「期望什么」，一旦不符就能在当下、用期望与实际的对照报出，而非像全局合一那样把错误推到很远——这正是 <a href=\"error-reporting\">类型错误诊断</a> 里「双向检查产出更好诊断」的机理。2025 年 10 月发表于 PACMPL 的《Incremental Bidirectional Typing via Order Maintenance》进一步把双向检查做成增量式，让编辑器能在每次击键后只重检受影响的部分（来源：dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/3763117）；ACM Computing Surveys 的《Bidirectional Typing》综述则系统梳理了从 Pierce-Turner 局部类型推断至今的整条发展脉络。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渐进类型的运行时代价\">渐进类型的运行时代价</h2><p>渐进类型不是免费的。当一个值从动态区流入静态区，编译器无法在编译期验证它真的符合静态类型，只能插入运行时检查（cast）。这些检查在边界上累积，可能带来可观的开销——著名的「渐进类型性能之坑」（the gradual typing performance problem）研究表明，部分类型化的程序在最坏配置下可能比全动态版本慢上数倍，因为边界检查密集。</p>\n<p>不同语言对此采取不同立场，形成一条「保证强度 vs 运行时代价」的光谱：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可靠渐进（sound gradual）</strong>：完整插入运行时检查，保证类型不被违反（Typed Racket）。代价是性能开销与可能的边界减速。</li>\n<li><strong>可选类型（optional typing）</strong>：类型只在编译期检查、运行时完全擦除、不插入任何检查（TypeScript、mypy、Python 类型注解）。零运行时开销，但静态保证不延伸到运行时，错误的 <code>any</code> 会悄悄穿透。</li>\n<li><strong>具体类型（concrete）</strong>：在对象上携带类型标签做轻量检查，介于两者之间。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Meta 在 2025 年 12 月发布的 Python 类型调查显示，代码质量与灵活性是开发者采用类型注解的首要原因，印证了「可选类型」这条几乎零运行时代价的路线在工业界的统治地位（来源：engineering.fb.com，2025-12-22）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"协同-渐进-双向的现代组合\">协同：渐进 + 双向的现代组合</h2><p>现代类型检查器很少单用其中之一。TypeScript 同时是渐进的（<code>any</code> 充当 <code>?</code>）和大量采用双向风格的（上下文类型 contextual typing 本质就是检查模式向下流动期望类型）。Flow、Hack、mypy 也走类似路线。这套组合的工程哲学，与 <a href=\"../advanced-typing/flow-sensitive-typing\">流敏感类型与细化</a> 选择「轻量细化而非完整 SMT」如出一辙：在表达力、性能、可用性的三角里找一个甜点，而非追求理论上的极致。把通过这套检查的程序连同类型信息交给后端，就进入了 <a href=\"semantic-ir-lowering\">语义检查到 IR 的下降</a>——渐进类型在那里决定哪些边界需要保留运行时 cast、哪些可以安全擦除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>渐进类型用动态类型 <code>?</code> 在静/动边界充当缓冲，靠「一致性」关系（与任何类型一致但不传递）跨越边界，区别于传递的子类型偏序。</li>\n<li>双向类型检查拆出检查（已知期望、验证）与综合（推出类型）两个方向，在应用与注解处切换，从而减少注解并使错误局部化。</li>\n<li>双向检查是「局部推断 + 注解兜底」的理论基础，也是双向检查产出更好诊断的机理；2025 年研究已将其做成增量式。</li>\n<li>渐进类型有运行时代价，形成「可靠渐进（插检查、Typed Racket）—可选类型（擦除、TS/mypy）—具体类型」的光谱；可选类型因零开销在工业界占主导。</li>\n<li>现代检查器（TypeScript 等）渐进与双向并用，与流敏感的「轻量优于极致」哲学一致，其结果交给 IR 下降决定哪些 cast 保留或擦除。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"渐进与双向类型检查","id":"渐进与双向类型检查"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"双向检查：检查与综合的分工","id":"双向检查-检查与综合的分工"},{"level":3,"text":"两个方向的伪代码","id":"两个方向的伪代码"},{"level":2,"text":"渐进类型的运行时代价","id":"渐进类型的运行时代价"},{"level":2,"text":"协同：渐进 + 双向的现代组合","id":"协同-渐进-双向的现代组合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型错误诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/type-checking-semantic-analysis/practice/error-reporting"},"next":{"title":"语义检查到 IR 的下降","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/type-checking-semantic-analysis/practice/semantic-ir-lowering"}}